window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-021-4c7a544ec2e1095c.json"]={sha256:"4c7a544ec2e1095cce8c4cc65f608d81bec5f2d94f1a130c1231442cb822136b",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-067b923c66f4ac46","url":"https://docs.kernel.org/networking/statistics.html","title":"Interface statistics","titleEn":"Interface statistics","publisher":"Linux kernel project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-021","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-021","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-022","referenceUrls":["https://docs.nvidia.com/networking-ethernet-software/cumulus-linux/Layer-1-and-Switch-Ports/Quality-of-Service/"],"title":"RoCE PFC：停止訊號往返中的緩衝餘裕","titleEn":"RoCE PFC: buffer headroom during pause response","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付 counter.csv、展開後計數器、有效性表與三種拒絕測例；本課不清除任何實際計數器；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver counter.csv, unwrapped positions, a validity table and three rejection cases. The local exercise never clears real counters, modifies interfaces or treats missing evidence as a measured zero. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"畫出暫停送出、來源停止、最後資料抵達三個事件；列出反應時間是否已包含往返與處理，避免重複加算。","differenceEn":"Draw pause issuance, source stopping and last-data arrival events. Define whether the reaction interval already includes propagation and processing, so a round trip is neither omitted nor counted twice.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["在確認恰好一次回繞的固定寬度模型中，差值為 modulus-old+new；速率再除以真實時間差；教學 16-bit 計數器由 65000 到 1000，epoch 相同且已確認一次回繞；時間差由 2 改為 4 秒；名義式 (65536-65000+1000)/2 = 768 B/s；變更式 (65536-65000+1000)/4 = 384 B/s。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","簡化餘裕為線速位元組率乘反應時間再加一個最大框；忽略晶片 cell 取整、額外 pipeline 與共享池競爭；教學資料率 25 GB/s，最大框 9000 B；反應時間由 3 微秒增加為 5 微秒；名義式 25e9*3e-6+9000 = 84000 B；變更式 25e9*5e-6+9000 = 134000 B。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["With exactly one confirmed wrap in a fixed-width counter, delta is modulus minus old plus new. Divide by the actual elapsed duration; multiple wraps cannot be inferred from only two samples. A synthetic 16-bit byte counter moves from 65000 to 1000 in the same epoch, with one wrap explicitly confirmed. Elapsed time changes from 2 to 4 seconds; these are not Linux’s native counter-width claims. Nominal (65536-65000+1000)/2 = 768 B/s; changed (65536-65000+1000)/4 = 384 B/s. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Simplified headroom equals byte rate times reaction time plus one maximum frame. Hardware cell rounding, additional pipelines and competition for shared buffers are excluded and must be added before operational configuration. Use a synthetic 25 decimal GB/s arrival rate and a 9000-byte maximum frame. Reaction time increases from 3 to 5 microseconds, with no claim that either value is a switch’s configured default. Nominal 25e9*3e-6+9000 = 84000 B; changed 25e9*5e-6+9000 = 134000 B. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-031","referenceUrls":["https://docs.lumi-supercomputer.eu/storage/parallel-filesystems/lustre/"],"title":"Lustre：檔案位移到 stripe 槽位的可逆映射","titleEn":"Lustre: reversible mapping from file offsets to stripe slots","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付 counter.csv、展開後計數器、有效性表與三種拒絕測例；本課不清除任何實際計數器；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver counter.csv, unwrapped positions, a validity table and three rejection cases. The local exercise never clears real counters, modifies interfaces or treats missing evidence as a measured zero. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"生成 layout.json 與 offset.csv；保存 slot_to_ost 獨立查表，再輸出 stripe_index、slot、object_offset 三欄。","differenceEn":"Create layout.json and offset.csv, with a separate slot-to-OST lookup. Emit stripe index, slot and object-local offset as separate fields, preserving the full mapping rather than returning only a storage target name.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["在確認恰好一次回繞的固定寬度模型中，差值為 modulus-old+new；速率再除以真實時間差；教學 16-bit 計數器由 65000 到 1000，epoch 相同且已確認一次回繞；時間差由 2 改為 4 秒；名義式 (65536-65000+1000)/2 = 768 B/s；變更式 (65536-65000+1000)/4 = 384 B/s。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","固定條帶模型中，槽位為 floor(offset/stripe_size) 對 stripe_count 取餘；物件內位移另由完整輪數與條帶內餘數計算；檔案位移 6 MiB、四個槽位且槽位從零起算；stripe_size 由 1 改為 2 MiB，不含 PFL 或鏡像布局；名義式 floor(6/1)-4*floor(floor(6/1)/4) = 2 zero-based slot；變更式 floor(6/2)-4*floor(floor(6/2)/4) = 3 zero-based slot。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["With exactly one confirmed wrap in a fixed-width counter, delta is modulus minus old plus new. Divide by the actual elapsed duration; multiple wraps cannot be inferred from only two samples. A synthetic 16-bit byte counter moves from 65000 to 1000 in the same epoch, with one wrap explicitly confirmed. Elapsed time changes from 2 to 4 seconds; these are not Linux’s native counter-width claims. Nominal (65536-65000+1000)/2 = 768 B/s; changed (65536-65000+1000)/4 = 384 B/s. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","For a fixed-stripe teaching layout, slot is the stripe index modulo stripe count. Object-local offset additionally depends on complete rounds and the remainder within a stripe, so slot alone is not a complete address. Use file offset 6 MiB and four zero-based slots. Stripe size changes from 1 to 2 MiB. The fixture excludes progressive layouts, mirrors and vendor-specific object identifiers. Nominal floor(6/1)-4*floor(floor(6/1)/4) = 2 zero-based slot; changed floor(6/2)-4*floor(floor(6/2)/4) = 3 zero-based slot. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-77ec1880d235c9b1","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/networking-ethernet-software/cumulus-linux/Layer-1-and-Switch-Ports/Quality-of-Service/","title":"Quality of Service","titleEn":"Quality of Service","publisher":"NVIDIA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-856df3e3986f0a20","url":"https://docs.lumi-supercomputer.eu/storage/parallel-filesystems/lustre/","title":"Lustre parallel filesystems","titleEn":"Lustre parallel filesystems","publisher":"LUMI consortium","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
